# Run artifacts, regenerated by setup_base.py / run_fleet_test.py. base.json
# holds VM ids from one particular run, and the event logs are per-run; re-render
# a report from a log you kept with `--report-only`.
#
# NOTE: deleting base.json does NOT delete the base VM — see README 'Tear down'.
base.json
fleet*.json
*.jsonl
